  "meta": {
    "version": "1.0",
    "status": "provisional",
    "note": "Crew registry used by the log editor (dev-tools/lore-devlog-editor.html). A log's ID is its department letter and a three digit crew number, written R-118. The number belongs to the person and stays with them: reassignment aboard the Charon is a long process, so the letter usually does too. Numbers are given out in order of assignment and are never reused. The departments and every number here are provisional until the facilities and department list is settled. D is reserved for the real-world developer."
  },
